WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
In Matthew, Mark and Luke, Jesus
clears the Temple in his last week.

2
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.470
In John, it happens at the start.

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.420
John has no parables.

4
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.170
It spreads the story across
three Passovers, not one.

5
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.700
And its author never gives his name.

6
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.810
So who wrote the Fourth Gospel, and why
does it tell the story so differently?

7
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.910
In this mission, you'll
weigh clues inside the text,

8
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.680
and clues from writers
of the early Church.

9
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.370
Then you'll test 4 views of who wrote it,

10
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.580
and ask what its stated
purpose really was.

11
00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:37.150
Your mission: find out who may have
written the Fourth Gospel, and why.
